thread of nuclear war,

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.160
we live with a perpetual
sense of our impending doom.

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:48.230
And we know we're not
alone in this sentiment.

00:00:48.230 --> 00:00:50.180
The fact that everything is hopeless

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:51.740
and the world is going to end soon

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:53.870
practically feels like common sense,

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:55.850
but are the gloom and doomers right?

00:00:55.850 --> 00:00:57.520
And if humans are totally screwed,

00:00:57.520 --> 00:01:00.950
what does our attitude about
the apocalypse say about us?

00:01:00.950 --> 00:01:04.070
